    },
    {
      "row": 18,
      "col": 1,
      "value": "1. That if the borrower(s) shall personally return IMMEDIATELY after use the borrowed items listed above to make it/them available for other users, borrower will be responsible for LOST and DAMAGES while the items are in my custody.",
      "css": "font-size:8pt;white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;"
    },
    {
      "row": 19,
      "col": 1,
      "value": "2. Students are not allowed to borrow equipment/materials. The instructor shall receive the items and sign as the borrower releasing and returning of items are within school days ONLY from 1:00 to 4:00 in the afternoon.",
      "css": "font-size:8pt;white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;"
    },
    {
      "row": 20,
      "col": 1,
      "value": "3. be held responsible for LOSS and DAMAGES while the items are in my custody.",
      "css": "font-size:8pt;white-space:normal;vertical-align:top;"
